cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: ATAC Prep
abstract: The first ATAC step of the Multiome Gene Regulation workflow. Imports 10x fragment files with
  SnapATAC2, keeps the nuclei that passed RNA QC (or Cell Ranger's cell calls), computes TSS enrichment,
  removes cells failing ATAC QC and writes one AnnData per sample with fragments, a 500 bp tile matrix and
  QC metrics, named like the RNA side.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/atac-prep
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
